PARMWHENCE(1)                  ZOAU Command Syntax                 PARMWHENCE(1)

NAME

	parmwhence - Find the dataset in the parmlib concatenation that a member
	comes from.

SYNOPSIS

	parmwhence [-dhv] <member-name>

	-d
		Print out debug messages.

	-h
		Display syntax help.

	-v
		Print out verbose command information.

DESCRIPTION

	Given a member, print the dataset it belongs to from the parmlib
	concatenation.

EXAMPLES

	Print out the name of the dataset that member IEAVIPCS is in.

		parmwhence ieavipcs

EXIT VALUES

	0
		Success

	Other
		Error, see message for details

SEE ALSO

	parmgrep(1)
